674615072965_3413322395941092730_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9WAQ2DyYLpoQ7kNvwEJwsXF&_nc_oc=Adr75Ii-07tEEtQGOSTb6tuOgSnWiKeyGd5tSFZQIhA5XznlS2EVEA3Q9jRuVTbh6VI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCUNY06lr3d20sjMJyukbkxnbSElSZ7BYMpj5V1dz5J7Q&oe=6A54FBE6"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 3.png", "id": "2085344095713801", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499620921_2085344099047134_8841374734274010883_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yAV1gJ0xXnUQ7kNvwEBVLno&_nc_oc=AdrYzuY1XskZpsAGVQuFNwoaZYvUkhL1-WSdu5qa0Bz2a5PdFX1OoeXCWW7LPT8x1Og&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCY8N-c9BX0CUSvu9e8PxOwlgIIflvtflG1yZSGXpr4gA&oe=6A54FA69"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot 6.png", "id": "2201954983888481", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623314_2201954987221814_5473371696396536745_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=od0QYJFyC3MQ7kNvwFaHyDu&_nc_oc=Adqwe_diTyTLofTV8sIldy6qbKmoqCS1JpsW6-mzd7KlsHP_JmE54vWfUMiKLFSGOwE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQCuGhMVCgnABpehtJ4mgC-BFGPIcjEJYPyxau_5DkmN-w&oe=6A54FCC9"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Hushlock", "keywords": ["escaperoom", "puzzle", "Mystery", "Team"], "long_description": "Welcome to Hushlock, an immersive VR experience built around one of the oldest and most rewarding human practices, solving something together. In this world, every locked door is a story, every overlooked detail is a clue, and every quiet moment with a teammate is a chance to think, listen, and figure it out as one.\nStep Into the Hush: From the moment you arrive, Hushlock pulls you into rooms that feel lived-in and full of secrets , a kitchen where something is not quite right, doors that hold more than wood and hinges, mechanisms whose logic only reveals itself to those who slow down and look. You move with your own hands, turn your own head, and notice the world the way you notice a real one.\nLearn the Quiet Skills: Each chamber rewards the team that talks honestly, points instead of demands, and waits for the slower thinker to finish the thought. As you progress, you become sharper inside the game and out \u2014 more attentive, more deliberate, more comfortable working shoulder-to-shoulder with someone who thinks differently.\nIgnite Collaboration: The world is full of locked rooms, at work, at home, in our communities,  and almost all of them open the same way: with people who decide to slow down, look together, and try. Step into Hushlock with someone you trust, or someone you want to know better, and discover what your teamwork sounds like when the world goes quiet enough to hear it.\n", "short_description": "Hushlock is an immersive cooperative VR experience that drops you and your teammates into intricate, lock-bound spaces where every whisper, every gesture, and every careful movement matters. Work together to uncover hidden mechanisms, decipher overlooked clues, and unlock the secrets sealed within each room, all while communicating in real time through your avatar."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://drive.google.com/file/d/1TVVP_rFW9tymBDQzAJoAHHLm5W1-K6hO/view?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Patrick Obumselu", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.lumever.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "suppo